### 🔹 Writing a Dockerfile

I learned how to create a **Dockerfile** for my pre-built project.

### 📄 Example Dockerfile (React App)

```dockerfile
# Use official Node image
FROM node:18

# Set working directory
WORKDIR /app

# Copy files
COPY . .

# Install dependencies
RUN npm install

# Build the app
RUN npm run build

# Start the app
CMD ["npm", "run", "preview"]
```

